summary:
  Twenty seconds of dead air are written down as the station's loudness.

history:
  ffmpeg reads -70.0 for silence. Kept as a reading it would stand for
  thirty days and leave a loud station at full level the whole time; as no
  number it is asked for again tomorrow.

target:
  package/contents/ui/LoudLogic.js

find:
      return typeof lufs === "number" && lufs > SILENT_LUFS && lufs <= LOUDEST_LUFS;

replace:
      return typeof lufs === "number" && lufs > -100 && lufs <= LOUDEST_LUFS;

expect:
  Killed by tests/qml/tst_loudlogic.qml::test_silence_and_what_no_decoder_puts_out_are_no_answer.
  Line-neutral.
